  {
   "id": "MAPMES25:5331b",
   "off": 340763,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "監視塔の屋上には\r明々と松明が点されている\u0010\b忍び込むのは難しそうだ\u0010\b",
   "en": "Torches burn brightly on the roof of the watchtower.\u0010\bSneaking in looks difficult.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES25:53360",
   "off": 340832,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "突然 異様な叫び声と悲鳴\rが塔の中から聞こえてきた\u0010\bフィンとグレイストーンは\r顔を見合わせ 小舟を着け\rさせた\u0010",
   "en": "Suddenly, strange cries and screams rang out from inside the tower.\u0010\bFinn and Greystone exchanged a glance and had the boat put in.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES25:533e9",
   "off": 340969,
